flowchart LR
    U[User Dashboard\nNews Tab] --> FE[Frontend script.js]
    FE --> API[POST /api/extract\nmode: news/non-AI]
    API --> JOB[Job Manager]
    JOB --> WF[Workflow.js]

    WF --> Q[Request Queue + Seed URL]
    WF --> CRAWL[Crawlee Cheerio or Puppeteer\nBased on page complexity]
    CRAWL --> FETCH[Fetcher.js\nAbort image/media/font]

    FETCH --> CLEAN[Cleaner.js]
    CLEAN --> READ[Mozilla Readability\nTitle + Date + Body]
    READ --> FALLBACK[Fallback DOM Cleanup\nif Readability fails]

    FALLBACK --> RESULT[Deterministic Article Record]
    RESULT --> DB[(SQLite\njobs + results)]
    RESULT --> SSE[SSE Status Stream]

    DB --> EXPORT[Export JSON/CSV]
    EXPORT --> FE
    SSE --> FE

    subgraph Safety and Control
      DEPTH[Depth Limit]
      DOMAIN[Same-Domain Link Extraction]
      MAXREQ[maxRequestsPerCrawl]
      ERR[Per-URL Error Capture]
      CANCEL[Cancellation Check]
    end

    DEPTH --> WF
    DOMAIN --> WF
    MAXREQ --> WF
    ERR --> WF
    CANCEL --> WF
